data: {"id": "04a588e8fccb4ea9-thinking-parallel_evidence-3634", "run_id": "04a588e8fccb4ea9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "拓扑事实确认：\n- **owned_by**: ReplicaSet `workload-5b5fc86c8c` → Deployment `workload`\n- **scheduled_on**: node2\n- **owns_container**: `app`\n\n所有事实一致。现在汇总证据。\n\n---\n\n## 证据结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n**1. Pod 生命周期状态 (Metrics + K8s YAML + Topology)**\n- Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` (UID: `86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`) 当前状态为 **Pending / ContainerCreating**\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`，reason=`ContainerCreating`\n- 调度到 **node2**，owner 为 Deployment `workload` → ReplicaSet `workloa", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788773537167, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

